"HTML Tidy Configuration Settings\n"
"\n"
"Within a file, use the form:\n"
"\n"
"wrap: 72\n"
"split: no\n"
"\n"
"When specified on the command line, use the form:\n"
"\n"
"--wrap 72 --split no\n"
